{"id":"656113","name":"芋艿白菜煲饭","author":"趣味下厨","authorId":"13085903","desc":"","cover":"images/656113/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"芋艿","amount":"300g"},{"name":"米饭","amount":"160g"},{"name":"白菜","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"3g"},{"name":"麻油","amount":"5g"},{"name":"松鲜鲜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜头","amount":"3颗"},{"name":"生姜","amount":"3片"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"芋艿洗净蒸熟。","img":"images/656113/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"剥去外皮。","img":"images/656113/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"三分钟爆香姜和蒜。","img":"images/656113/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入芋艿翻炒5分钟再加黄酒。","img":"images/656113/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入米饭继续炒五分钟。","img":"images/656113/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入白菜炒三分钟出锅。","img":"images/656113/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"出锅前加盐，松鲜鲜和麻油。","img":"images/656113/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}